322	 * equals an existing owner's — an exact duplicate; or</li>
323	 * <li>an existing owner shares the new owner's household (same {@code (lastName, postcode)}, hence
324	 * the same computed householdId) — a household duplicate. This is bypassed when the request opts in
325	 * with {@code sharesHousehold} true, in which case the owner is created as a declared household
326	 * member.</li>
327	 * </ul>
